    ["当红月再度轮转为一个饱满的圆，“囚犯”途径的诅咒便也如影随形。\n马里奇在苦苦挣扎。作为“活尸”的他，正压抑着那渴求温热血液与鲜活血肉的欲望。冷汗从额头上一滴滴坠下，就如同曾经的无数个满月时分。\n节制，抑或是放纵——\n放纵容易，可放纵之后的他是否还是真正的他？\n好在还有深红月冕的帮助，那件不断散发着绯红清辉的饰品，使佩戴者得以免除满月的影响……理智最终还是在摇摇欲坠中站稳了脚跟。\n今夜的月色依旧是缥缈的红纱，今夜的自我依旧是那个马里奇。 "] = "When the red moon turns into a full circle once again, the curse of the Prisoner pathway follows like a shadow. \n Maric was struggling bitterly. As a Zombie, he was suppressing the desire for warm blood and fresh flesh. Cold sweat dripped from his forehead, just like on countless previous full moons. \n Temperance, or indulgence— \n Indulgence is easy, but after indulging, would he still be the true him? \n Fortunately, there was the help of the Crimson Moon Crown, an accessory that constantly emitted a crimson radiance, allowing the wearer to be spared from the influence of the full moon... Reason finally stood firm amidst the precariousness. \n Tonight's moonlight is still a hazy red veil, and tonight's self is still that same Maric.",
